      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 World Kidney Day 2017 Steering Committee. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Obesity is a growing worldwide epidemic. Obesity is one of the strongest risk factors for new-onset chronic kidney disease, and also for nephrolithiasis and for kidney cancer. This year the World Kidney Day promotes education on the harmful consequences of obesity and its association with kidney disease, advocating healthy lifestyle and health policy measures that make preventive behaviors an affordable option."
